    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University Hospital, Nairobi, announced that it has invested more than KES 600 million (US $5.9 million) to become the first hospital in the region to introduce a state-of-the-art technology that will improve the diagnosis and treatment of cancer, heart disease and other diseases.",
